SDL-E1021 (spec/README.md#design-rules-settled)

  x expected an f-string (`f'…'`) or the `silo::` prefix
   ,----
 1 | module color { from: 'memory'; unsigned; };
   :                       ^^^^|^^^^
   :                           `-- not a module executable
   `----
  help: the `from` clause takes an f-string (`f'bucket:/key.surli'`) or a Silo package (`silo::org::pkg::<1.2.0>`)
